Compass information to more conveniently understand the situation at your current location.

[The Main Function]
1. Compass: Instantly obtain directional data without being connected to the Internet, and quickly identify various directions such as guide and north;
2. Altitude: Obtain the altitude data of the current positioning location in real time and save historical data;
3. GPS: Get accurate GPS location, latitude and longitude, and detailed address data in real time;
4. Barometer: obtain current atmospheric pressure data in real time and save historical data;
5. Oxygen: obtain current oxygen content data in real time and save historical data;
6. Weather: Get various weather data such as temperature, body temperature, dew point temperature, precipitation, visibility, humidity, etc. in real time;
7. Wind Power: obtain wind speed, wind direction, and wind direction angle data in real time;
8. Boiling point: Get the boiling point data of water at the current altitude in real time;
9. Sunrise and Sunset: Get the sunrise and sunset data of the current location in real time;
10. Moonrise and Moonset: Get the moonrise and moonset data of the current positioning position in real time;
11. Magnetometer: Get magnetometer data in real time;
12. SOS: Various wilderness survival guides, rescue guides, and rescue telephone numbers. You can view tutorials to quickly seek help;

[Main Pain Points]
Outdoor travel: Help you quickly find the right direction in unknown places;
Wilderness adventure: Keep you from getting lost in unfamiliar places or outdoor activities;
Suitable for use during travel, long and short distance hiking, mountain climbing, running, self-driving cross-country, skiing, outdoor photography, wild treasure hunting camping and other outdoor activities;

